@host = http://localhost:5109

### 1. Log in to get a JWT (copy the token into @token below)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

###
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Verify the token
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────── CARS ───────────────────────────────

### List all cars (public)
GET {{host}}/api/cars

### Only cars available to rent (used by the mobile app)
GET {{host}}/api/cars/available

### Filter by status: Available | Rented | UnderMaintenance
GET {{host}}/api/cars?status=Available

### Get one car
GET {{host}}/api/cars/1

### Create a car (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "model": "Camry 2024",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "pricePerDay": 150.00,
  "imageUrl": "/uploads/camry.jpg"
}

### Update a car — omit "status" to KEEP the current one
PUT {{host}}/api/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "model": "Camry 2024",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "pricePerDay": 175.00,
  "imageUrl": "/uploads/camry.jpg"
}

### Take a car out of circulation
PUT {{host}}/api/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "model": "Camry 2024",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "pricePerDay": 175.00,
  "status": "UnderMaintenance"
}

### Delete a car (409 if it has any rental history)
DELETE {{host}}/api/cars/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ───────────────────────────── CUSTOMERS ────────────────────────────

### List customers (admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Anas Sadeq",
  "email": "anas@example.com",
  "phone": "0500000000"
}

### Update a customer
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Anas S.",
  "email": "anas@example.com",
  "phone": "0500000001"
}

### Delete a customer (409 if they have rentals)
DELETE {{host}}/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ────────────────────────────── RENTALS ─────────────────────────────

### Book a car. TotalPrice is calculated by the server.
POST {{host}}/api/rentals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carId": 1,
  "customerId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-08"
}

### List all rentals (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One customer's rental history
GET {{host}}/api/rentals/customer/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one rental
GET {{host}}/api/rentals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change the rental period (TotalPrice is recalculated; status preserved)
PUT {{host}}/api/rentals/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-10"
}

### Complete the rental — releases the car back to Available
PUT {{host}}/api/rentals/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel the rental — also releases the car
PUT {{host}}/api/rentals/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a rental (frees its car if it was active)
DELETE {{host}}/api/rentals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────── OTHER ──────────────────────────────

### Health probe
GET {{host}}/health
